                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "live · open enrollment"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 1
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Neighborhood Resiliency Programs because there is no going it alone."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When the power goes out on your block, do you know which neighbor has a generator? When the creek floods, do you know the evacuation routes? We run our Neighborhood Resiliency Program to help neighborhoods organize their resources, relationships, and knowledge to support healthy, vibrant, and connected communities-of-place to cultivate their practical preparedness in case of emergency."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_1xdg5t6g27",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
